 - Many hotels and certain credit cards offer special deals on admission to certain attractions; 
 - Some US school-break programs or family-friendly websites/ apps (e.g. Kiwi) offer deals or special offers during specified periods; and 
 - You may find special offers or discounts by joining membership or fan clubs related to specific attractions or brands (e.g. for Marriott Rewards members, there is a 10% discount on all purchases at the Disney Stores worldwide). However, these are all legal and reputable ways to save money on attraction admission. There is no 'sneak in for free' way – this would likely be unethical and probably involve breaking the rules of the attraction or breaching its security.

